	\L_04332:
	ZH 1:
	'Thanks for everything, Ms.'
	R
	'Maris.'
	\L_043e7:
	ZH 1:
	'I was able to get plenty of'
	R
	'girls as sacrifices,'
	\L_043e7:
	ZH 1:
	'and now I’m finally allowed to'
	R
	'depart to space...'
	\L_043e7:
	ZH 1:
	'So long, adieu.'
	\L_043e7:
	\L_043da:
	\L_04394:
	\L_042fa:
	ZH 1:
	'Maris continued to stand'
	R
	'dumbfounded and paralyzed as'
	R
	'Mars the Great nimbly boarded'
	\L_043e7:
	ZH 1:
	'the saucer and flew away.'
	\L_043e7:
	\L_043da:
	\L_042c2:
	ZH 1:
	'............'
	\L_043e7:
	ZH 1:
	'.........'
	\L_043e7:
	ZH 1:
	'......'
	\L_043e7:
	ZH 1:
	'I-I’ll pretend I didn’t see'
	R
	'that.'
	\L_043e7:
	ZH 1:
	'Even if I reported this to'
	R
	'King Rance, he wouldn’t'
	R
	'believe it...'
	\L_043e7:
	\L_043da:
	\L_0436a:
	ZH 1:
	'Maris muttered as though to'
	R
	'convince herself while she'
	R
	'returned to her room.'
	\L_043e7:
	\L_043da:
	\L_04324:
	\L_042fa:
	ZH 1:
	'The next day.'
	\L_043e7:
	ZH 1:
	'The topic of Mars the Great’s'
	R
	'disappearance was brought up'
	R
	'several times,'
	\L_043e7:
	ZH 1:
	'but nobody knew much about it.'
	\L_043e7:
	ZH 1:
	'In the end, everyone focused'
	R
	'on other conversations or'
	R
	'their own work.'
	\L_043e7:
	\L_043da:
	!VAR0516 : 6!
	\L_04316:
	\L_042c2:
	ZH 1:
	'............'
	\L_043e7:
	\L_043da:
	\L_042fa:
	ZH 1:
	'Among them, Maris was thinking.'
	\L_043e7:
	\L_043da:
	\L_042de:
	ZH 1:
	'Mars the Great went to space...'
	R
	'What in the world was he...?'
	\L_043e7:
	ZH 1:
	'There’s still many'
	R
	'unfathomable mysteries this in'
	R
	'this world...'
	\L_043e7:
	\L_043da:
	\L_042fa:
	ZH 1:
	'Then Maris returned to her'
	R
	'everyday duties, as well.'
	\L_043e7:
	\L_043da:
